Cell["\<\
Ok.  comparison with Joot\[CloseCurlyQuote]s answer passed, however above \
computation of gaReciprocalVectorRules[ ] is very complicated. Will attempt \
to implement reciprocal vectors computation using mvD.\
\>", "Text",
