Cell["\<\
Note, that in coordinate system length of second basis vectors increase with \
\[Rho], whereas in non-coordinate basis it remains the same. Therefore in the \
later case it is not possible to define coordinate system.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"78179ed1-34bf-4cc3-95a4-1e095c95af2d"],

