Cell["\<\
Mathematica data set call variables, whereas we call them parameters, and \
vice versa. From our point of view variables parametrize the surface. Whereas \
\[OpenCurlyDoubleQuote]parameters\[CloseCurlyDoubleQuote] are free constants, \
which are fixed when surface is specified. \
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.902993850736476*^9, 
  3.9029940135370007`*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"90bcd74a-ebec-467a-8369-\
a723da350bc7"],

